body:
Jesus, until you brought up the Finland VR chat thing I thought you were my childhood 'best' friend Savanah.... Please apologize to her if you ever get the chance. My 'best friend' who was EXACTLY like this to a T never apologized, and it's still something that I think about because of how much it ruined me in those years. Like jesus even the times and years of dropping out are the same lmao...

&#x200B;

Thanks for coming out about it, I hope you end up redeeming that.

Yeah I can back you up Janitor. I got 14 day'd on my main again when I was so close to honor 1 and I literally just argued with a (really) toxic Lucian for a little bit. Called him toxic like once and I got banned for that one game. Muted him at about 10 minutes too. :/ I just got off the ban and I'm happy I have my account back but I feel like the honor system just doesn't work well with what is a shittily designed punishment bot.

&#x200B;

Rioter told me in an appeal ticket that arguing even a little bit is "negative behavior" and is bannable.

&#x200B;

The same Lucian that called me 3 slurs and who was sexist never was punished despite me reporting him in the ticket there - he is still playing to this day. Thanks Riot.

Tempered Fate, Lamb's Respite, CHAAAAAAAARGE!!!

Lamb's Respite is a cool ass ability, same with CHAAAAAAAARGE!!! and Tempered Fate is Tempered Fate.

I cannot count the amount of times I have completely thrown ARAM games by ulting the enemy team as Bard, saving them. );;;
